@startuml Sequence Diagram - Login
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Login\nSistem Prediksi Penyebaran DBD

actor User
participant Browser
participant "Flask App\n(auth.py)" as flask
participant "User Model" as model
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as db

== Login Flow ==

User -> Browser : 1: Masukkan username dan password
Browser --> User : 2: Tampilkan form login
User -> Browser : 3: Submit login (POST /auth/login)
Browser -> flask : 4: login(username, password)
flask -> model : 5: query.filter_by(username)
model -> db : 6: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username=?
db --> model : 7: return user_record
note left of model : Note: Password diverifikasi\nmenggunakan bcrypt/werkzeug
flask -> model : 8: check_password(password)
model --> flask : 9: return True/False

alt [Valid]
    flask -> flask : 10: login_user(), create session
    note right of flask : Note: Session disimpan\ndengan Flask-Login
    flask --> Browser : 11: redirect('/dashboard')
else [Invalid]
    flask -> flask : 10: flash('Username atau password salah')
    flask --> Browser : 11: render_template('login.html')
end

Browser --> User : 12: Tampilkan halaman

@enduml
